  "plain": "In 1996, in the Brazilian town of Varginha, the local fire department is said to have caught a strange screaming creature with a net, \"like they would with a wild animal.\" The documentary filmmaker James Fox tells Michels this from what witnesses told him during his long investigation of the case. It is one piece of the larger Varginha story, in which people say a craft crashed and living non-human beings were caught and taken to hospitals."
